abstract: >-
  Google Earth Engine and Python code for mapping annual shifting-cultivation (jhum) clearing
  from harmonized Landsat 5/7/8/9 using symmetric anniversary composites of the Normalized Burn
  Ratio, with a Sentinel-2 implementation for 2025. Includes the compositing experiment, the
  five-stratum dual-map validation sampler, the sensor consistency and transition tests, the
  regional transfer test and the scripts that draw every figure in the paper. Mizoram,
  north-east India, 1989-2025.
